   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. ask loop     asking -> owner proposal -> answered      (structural; batched per appearance; parks on timeout)\n2. grade loop   enriched -> grader -> bounce -> answered  (grader walled off from the enricher; deterministic checks first)\n3. speak loop   kept -> next session opens with it       (relevance, tension, accumulation, unfinished, loved)\n4. learn loop   a hundred answers -> fewer future asks   (open: where standing rules live, step 2)",
   "originalText": "1. ask loop     asking -> owner proposal -> answered      (structural; batched per appearance; parks on timeout)\n2. grade loop   enriched -> grader -> bounce -> answered  (grader walled off from the enricher; deterministic checks first)\n3. speak loop   kept -> next session opens with it       (relevance, tension, accumulation, unfinished, loved)\n4. learn loop   a hundred answers -> fewer future asks   (open: where standing rules live, step 2)",
   "fontSize": 12,
